{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662260/extras/45d0dea9857c01bed2c4c2191a1ae08e.avif?t=1768236761\" width=1228 height=544 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Tide</strong> is a story driven, action adventure set on a remote tropical island. You play as Doug, a laid-back stoner, accompanied by his fun-loving friend Marcus, as they arrive to oversee a construction project that\u2019s mysteriously abandoned. Soon, the duo discovers that the island is cursed, inhabited by strange creatures, and protected by ancient spirits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Island</strong><br>Explore dense jungles, abandoned construction sites, and hidden villages while solving environmental puzzles, gathering rare resources, and assisting the island\u2019s locals to restore balance. Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover the island\u2019s history, retrieve sacred artifacts, and navigate humorous, chaotic situations with Doug and Marcus\u2019s irreverent banter.<br><br><strong>The Curse</strong><br>Ancient spirits and corrupted creatures threaten the island. Players must retrieve sacred artifacts, gather mystical resources, and complete rituals to restore harmony. Careless actions can worsen the corruption, increasing the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong><br><i>High Tide</i> blends exploration, puzzle-solving, and light combat in a relaxed but engaging adventure, offering players a mix of mystery, strategy, and humor as they work to lift the island\u2019s curse.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3662260?t=1768236761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662260/e79bd4a4e9328a4af1ab22897972df3f668ca366/page_bg_ra